# Project plans storage (mandatory)

Read and obey whenever the Owner asks to **plan**, **design**, **prepare a build plan**,
**Phase 0**, **MVP scope**, or similar.

## Canonical location

**All Owner build plans → `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`**

These are **Cursor Plans** (interactive todos + overview), **not** markdown docs in `docs/`.

Do **not** save build plans under `docs/`, chat-only output, or global `~/.cursor/plans/`.

If Plan mode / CreatePlan writes to the global Cursor folder, **immediately copy**
the plan into `.cursor/plans/` with `isProject: true` and tell the Owner the
project path — global-only is not acceptable.

## When to save (automatic)

Create or update a `.plan.md` file **without asking** when:

1. The Owner requests a plan to build later
2. You produce a structured multi-section plan (phases, scope, checklist, architecture)
3. Plan-mode output is meant to be kept for future execution

## Required file format

Filename: `<topic_slug>.plan.md` (snake_case, e.g. `sumit_integration_phase_0.plan.md`)

```yaml
---
name: Human-readable title
overview: One-paragraph summary of goal and scope
todos:
  - id: kebab-case-id
    content: "Actionable step"
    status: pending
isProject: true
---

# Plan body (markdown sections as needed)
```

Rules:
- **`isProject: true`** always — ties the plan to this repo
- **`todos`** must list concrete build steps the Owner can track in Cursor Plans UI
- Update the same file in place unless the Owner asks for a new version

## After saving

Tell the Owner the exact path (e.g. `.cursor/plans/my_feature.plan.md`) in one short line.

## Not plans (keep elsewhere)

| Type | Location |
|------|----------|
| Audits, closure reports, investigations | `docs/audits/` |
| Product specs / gap matrices | `docs/product/` |
| Active wave implementation notes | `docs/implementation/` |
